  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tCapium 365\n\t\tCapium 365 FAQs\n\n### How can I purchase licences in Capium 365?\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Fri, 16 May, 2025 at  2:44 PM\n\n\t\tYou can purchase licences in Capium 365 in one of two ways:\n\n1. You can call us on 02033225578 and speak to one of the sales team directly\n\n2. Login in to Capium > MyAdmin > Click “MySubscription” at the top > Click “Capium 365” > Select how many clients you want to purchase > Click “Go To Cart” > Click “Upgrade Plan”\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
